message.content:
Let me analyze the vulnerability. In `parse_proxy_protocol_v2`:

```c
size = proto_signature_length + (unsigned int)ntohs(hdr->len);
if (UNLIKELY(size > (unsigned int)sizeof(*hdr)))
    return NULL;
```

The check is `size > sizeof(*hdr)`. Let me look at the `proxy_header_v2` struct definition to understand the buffer sizes.

